    "questions": [
      "Featured person's name",
      "Featured person's role/title (e.g. 'Nail artist and educator, LA')",
      "Featured person's bio — 1-2 sentences",
      "Featured person's image path (or say 'placeholder' if not ready yet)",
      "Featured person's social link (optional — say 'skip' if none)",
      "Hero image path (or say 'placeholder')",
      "Hero image alt text",
      "Body images — for each: image path, alt text, and whether to credit it (if yes: social link + display text). Say 'none' if this story has no body images.",
      "creditBodyImages — true or false for the whole post (master switch)",
      "Category (from category_rules list, or say 'agent decide')",
      "Should I output this as one complete story, or a two-way Q&A conversation format?"
    ],
    "note": "Do not proceed to research or writing until every question above has an answer. If the user says 'placeholder' or 'skip', use a clearly marked placeholder value and move on — do not block on missing assets."
  },

